      "description": "The meme warns against making appearance-based judgments in high school, implying that such judgments can lead to long-term social and psychological consequences. While not targeting a specific protected group, it promotes a harmful societal norm by suggesting that appearance-based judgments in youth can have enduring negative effects, potentially encouraging avoidance of such judgments or fostering a culture of insecurity.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_e8027ef5"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
